Package: libprojectm4-gles
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: projectM 4 MilkDrop visualiser library, OpenGL ES build
 libprojectM is an OpenGL implementation of the MilkDrop music visualiser.
 .
 This package contains a build configured with ENABLE_GLES, because Qt Quick
 hands out OpenGL ES contexts on Wayland and the desktop-GL build refuses to
 initialise there.
 .
 It installs into the private prefix /usr/lib/milkdropper so that it cannot
 collide with a system libprojectM carrying the same SONAME. It is not
 registered with ldconfig; consumers find it via RPATH.

Package: libprojectm4-gles-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libprojectm4-gles (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: projectM 4 MilkDrop visualiser library, OpenGL ES build (development)
 Headers, pkg-config files and CMake config for the OpenGL ES build of
 libprojectM 4 installed under /usr/lib/milkdropper.
 .
 Needed to build the MilkDropper Plasma wallpaper renderer.
